### A blank line ends the headers
POST https://example.com/notes
Accept: */*

Content-Type: text/plain
X-Trace: 1
hello

### Header-like lines after body text are content
POST https://example.com/notes
Content-Type: text/plain

https://example.com/link
Note: this line comes after body text

### JSON keys are quoted, so they're never headers
POST https://example.com
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "fine"
}
